REPORT_OFFLINE_REQUIRED|`A scheduled report requires a background worker.`
REPORT_DELIVERY_UNCERTAIN|`Report delivery outcome is uncertain. Check the mail server before retrying.`
REPORT_PDF_EMPTY|`The report did not produce a PDF attachment.`
REPORT_BODY_EMPTY|`The report did not produce email content.`
